title "Build graph of a monorepo"

app-web [globe]: app-web
app-mobile [smartphone]: app-mobile
app-admin [shield]: app-admin
ui [palette]: ui-kit
forms [list-checks]: forms
charts [chart-bar]: charts
auth [key]: auth-client
api [api]: api-client
http [arrow-right-left]: http
logger [file-text]: logger
config [settings]: config
types [code]: types
utils [wrench]: utils

app-web -> ui
app-web -> forms
app-web -> charts
app-web -> auth
app-mobile -> ui
app-mobile -> auth
app-mobile -> api
app-admin -> ui
app-admin -> forms
app-admin -> charts
app-admin -> api
ui -> utils
ui -> types
forms -> ui
forms -> utils
charts -> utils
charts -> types
auth -> api
auth -> logger
api -> http
api -> types
http -> logger
http -> config
logger -> config
logger -> utils

mark utils "depends on utils"
mark types "depends on types"
